  (text "Redrawn from public sources: see docs/bassdrive/circuit-notes.md, sections 3 and 4.\nR31, C10, C8: values reported [2]; their position in a non-inverting stage is inferred.\nUX1: the core is reported as discrete [4]. An ideal op-amp stands in for the stage's\nsmall-signal behaviour (chosen). 9 V supply documented [1]. VB: bias rail, about 4.5 V.\nRVX1, RX2: Gain pot (1M log) and series resistor (chosen, section 4). RX1: input bias (chosen).\nX in a designator marks a part the notes add; it has no counterpart in the sources." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 78.74 140.97 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0081da0e-59b0-5cff-8163-7ad8ad7e8933"))
)
